Each iteration draws a fresh batch ℬt\mathcal{B}\_{t} from the annotated pool 𝒟\mathcal{D} with trace-level labels, ensuring a balanced distribution of correct and incorrect reasoning traces. The curriculum filtering then constructs the training set 𝒟t\mathcal{D}\_{t} as described above, and RL optimization updates the policy based on the structured reward.

